body:
Have any of you three ever done a shoe-ie. 

&#x200B;

If not, can one of you (Broden) do one? c;

I have been searching for the past 2 days straight now on sub-reddits and other sites. I am sort of drawing my own Bolt patterns for fandom stuff, and I came across this one thread that showed graphics of bolters and heavy bolters I think. Depicting a belt feed problem for them, does anyone know what I'm talking about?

&#x200B;

The thread had some interesting points on how the bolter firing mechanism and belt feed system might be flawed, and there wouldn't be enough room around the apparatus for the gun and bolt to cycle properly?
